{"title":"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"h2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eDiscover the Beauty of Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRealistic artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas are designed to capture the natural beauty of a real evergreen into your home. Designed with lifelike foliage, natural color variation, and carefully crafted branch structure, these trees offer a more authentic appearance while maintaining the convenience of an artificial design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur collection includes a variety of realistic styles, from full and traditional silhouettes to slim options for smaller spaces. Whether you prefer a pre-lit tree for effortless setup or an unlit option for complete customization, each tree is built with high-quality materials for long-lasting durability.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of realistic artificial Christmas trees to find a tree that brings depth, dimension, and lifelike charm to your holiday décor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a realistic Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA realistic Christmas tree is an artificial tree designed to closely replicate the look and feel of a real evergreen. These trees are typically made with advanced PE (polyethylene) branch tips in addition to classic tips that create a more natural texture and appearance compared to traditional 100% PVC trees such as our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/classic-trees\" title=\"Classic Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eclassic Christmas tree collection\u003c\/a\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas realistic artificial Christmas trees feature detailed branch tips, subtle color variation, and organic shaping, resulting in a fuller and more lifelike appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a realistic artificial Christmas tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRealistic artificial Christmas trees are an ideal choice for those who want the look of a real tree without the upkeep. With added depth, dimension, and natural shaping, these trees create a more realistic look, making them a great option for those transitioning from a real tree or seeking a more refined aesthetic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThey offer a balance of realism and value which makes them a popular choice for those who want a beautifully realistic tree without stepping into the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\" title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003epremium\u003c\/a\u003e tier.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat styles are available in realistic Christmas trees?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas offers many sizes, styles and shapes of realistic Christmas trees including flocked, slim, full and sparse designs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFull trees offer a traditional, wide shape with layered branches for a natural appearance, while slim trees provide a narrower profile for apartments or smaller rooms. We also offer both pre-lit and unlit options for added flexibility.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat size realistic Christmas tree should I choose?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor the best fit, we recommend allowing 6 to 12 inches of space between the top of your tree and the ceiling. This allows room for a tree topper while helping the tree feel balanced and proportionate within your space. King of Christmas tree heights include the stand. To learn more, explore our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/pages\/tree-buying-guide\" title=\"Tree Buying Guide\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTree Buying Guide\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRealistic vs. Premium Artificial Christmas Trees: What’s the difference?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRealistic artificial Christmas trees offer a natural, lifelike appearance with detailed foliage, subtle color variation, and organic branch structure. They are a great option for those who want the look of a real tree at a more accessible price point.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\" title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePremium artificial Christmas trees\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e take realism a step further, featuring a higher percentage of PE branch tips and enhanced detail for an even more refined and true-to-life appearance. These trees are often chosen as statement pieces for those looking for the highest level of realism and craftsmanship. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eBoth styles offer the same convenience, durability, and ease of setup that make artificial trees a popular choice. The difference ultimately comes down to the level of detail and realism you’re looking for in your holiday centerpiece.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our selection of realistic artificial Christmas trees to discover a style that brings warmth, depth, and lasting beauty to your holiday season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642896805952,"sku":"QF-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5_67d3c5cc-8f63-4646-82b6-ac5667cde3ad.jpg?v=1718158334"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"produ